    "description": {
      "unidentified": "<h3>Statistics</h3><p><b>Damage</b> 1d6 (small), 1d8 (medium); <b>Critical</b> 20/x2; <b>Type</b> Slashing</p><h3>Description</h3>\n<h3>Power Rod</h3>\n<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 50 gil</p><p><strong>Damage:</strong> 1d4 (small), 1d4 (medium)</p><p><strong>Critical:</strong> x2</p><p><strong>Weight:</strong> 3 lbs.</p><p><strong>Type:</strong> Elemental</p><p><strong>Range Increment:</strong> 30 ft. (Max)</p><p><strong>Special:</strong> —</p><p>Power Weapons are built for mages or anyone with an MP pool and a caster level. It requires an MP pool and caster level to use, even with Exotic Weapon Proficiency. They are supernatural and do not function within anti-magic fields. Instead of Strength or Dexterity, Power Weapons deal extra elemental damage equal to the wielder's casting modifier, capped by caster level.</p><p>Ranged Power Weapons have a set range of 30 feet and use ranged touch attacks, provoking attacks of opportunity.</p>"
